---
import Tbd from './Tbd.astro';
import { site, usd } from '../data/site';
const { price, terms, founder } = site;
---

<section class="section faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="wrap faq-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="label" data-reveal>Questions</p>
      <h2 id="faq-title" class="display" data-reveal style="--i:1">
        Asked by <em>every owner</em> I talk to.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item" data-reveal style="--i:1" name="faq">
        <summary><span>How much should I budget for ad spend?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>
            The minimum is {usd(price.adSpendMin)} a month, paid directly to Meta. On the first call
            I work backwards from what a new patient is worth to you and recommend a number. If it
            does not make sense for your margins, I will say so.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" data-reveal style="--i:2" name="faq">
        <summary><span>Is there a contract?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>
            A {terms.minimumMonths}-month minimum, then month to month with
            {terms.noticePeriod ?? <Tbd label="notice period" />} written notice. Your ad accounts
            and all the creative stay yours. The landing page is yours to keep after
            {price.ownershipPayments} payments.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" data-reveal style="--i:3" name="faq">
        <summary><span>How fast will I see results?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>
            Campaigns go live within two weeks of approving the plan. Expect the first two to four
            weeks to be learning, then a clear trend by the end of month two. You get the honest
            timeline on the call.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" data-reveal style="--i:4" name="faq">
        <summary><span>Which platforms do you run ads on?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>
            Facebook and Instagram only. That is where med spa patients follow providers, compare
            before-and-afters and decide where to book.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" data-reveal style="--i:5" name="faq">
        <summary><span>How do you handle patient privacy and tracking?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>
            There are no ad pixels on your booking pages, so nothing about who books or what they
            book is sent to Meta. Results are measured from lead counts and from booked consults
            in your own booking software. Patient records stay where they are.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item" data-reveal style="--i:6" name="faq">
        <summary><span>Who will I work with?</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>
            Me, {founder.name}, directly. I plan, build and run your account, write your weekly
            email and take your monthly call. No hand-off to a junior account manager.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-grid { display: grid; gap: 2.5rem; }
  @media (min-width: 56rem) { .faq-grid { grid-template-columns: 5fr 7fr; gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem); } }
  .faq-grid .display { font-size: var(--t-1); margin-top: 1.25rem; max-width: 12ch; }

  .faq-item { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .faq-item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  summary {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.4rem 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: var(--t-3);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
    transition: color 0.25s var(--ease-out);
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  summary:hover { color: var(--brass-2); }
  summary:hover .faq-icon,
  summary:focus-visible .faq-icon { border-color: var(--brass); color: var(--brass-2); }
  details[open] .faq-icon { background: var(--brass); border-color: var(--brass); color: var(--bg); }
  summary:focus-visible { outline-offset: -2px; }

  .faq-icon {
    position: relative;
    flex: 0 0 1.5rem;
    width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 50%;
    transition: border-color 0.3s var(--ease-out), background-color 0.4s var(--ease-out), color 0.3s var(--ease-out);
  }
  .faq-icon::before, .faq-icon::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 50% auto auto 50%;
    width: 0.6rem; height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
    translate: -50% -50%;
    transition: rotate 0.4s var(--ease-out);
  }
  .faq-icon::after { rotate: 90deg; }
  details[open] .faq-icon::after { rotate: 0deg; }

  .faq-body { padding-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ink-2); max-width: 60ch; line-height: 1.6; }
  .faq-body p { text-wrap: pretty; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .faq-icon::before, .faq-icon::after { transition: none; } }
</style>
